    "In the afternoon I",
    "took the night",
    "boat for Boston.",
    "Darling, beloved",
    "Motherling came",
    "down and saw me",
    "off.",
    "On the boat I",
    "felt awfully home-",
    "-sick; and, oh! so",
    "heartsick for",
    "Father."
   ],
